  "releaseNotes": "- Added intuitive Freeze Panes helper methods as worksheet extensions\n    - New methods include FreezeTopRow(), FreezeFirstColumn(), FreezeTopRowAndFirstColumn()\n    - Added support for freezing multiple rows (FreezeTopRows()) or columns (FreezeLeftColumns())\n    - Implemented FreezePanesAt() for freezing at specific cell positions (e.g., \"C3\")\n    - Added UnfreezePanes() method to remove existing freeze panes\n    - All methods support fluent method chaining for improved code readability",
